---
layout: base.njk
title: Page Not Found - Bloogsite
description: The requested page could not be found. Browse recent Bloogsite articles or search the site.
permalink: /404.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<main class="not-found" id="main-content">

<div class="not-found-copy">
<p class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
<h1>That page wandered off.</h1>
<p>The link may be outdated or the address may contain a typo. Choose a route below to continue exploring Bloogsite.</p>

<nav class="not-found-actions" aria-label="Page recovery options">
<a class="not-found-primary" href="/">Return home</a>
<a href="/#article-search">Search articles</a>
<a href="/categories/">Browse categories</a>
</nav>
</div>

{% set recentPosts = collections.posts | limit(3) %}
{% if recentPosts.length %}
<section class="not-found-recent" aria-labelledby="recent-articles-title">
<div class="not-found-recent-heading">
<p>Fresh from the library</p>
<h2 id="recent-articles-title">Recent articles</h2>
</div>

<ul>
{% for post in recentPosts %}
<li>
<a href="{{ post.url }}">
<span>{{ post.data.category | catName(categories) }}</span>
<strong>{{ post.data.title or "Untitled article" }}</strong>
<span class="not-found-read">Read article →</span>
</a>
</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</section>
{% endif %}

</main>
